WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:08,280
It’s open! You can go in!

2
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:10,080
Why did you learn this skill?

3
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:11,680
I got obsessed with escape rooms in college

4
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:13,680
For more difficult scripts, there will be no key.

5
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:16,880
Set up a plot that requires other methods to open the lock

6
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:22,140
Please lower your voice and tell me what you want to say.

7
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:24,840
I guess as long as the sound is not too loud, it won't attract them.

8
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:27,900
Is this the dungeon BOSS that veteran players mentioned before?

9
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,400
That can't be Xuangui, right?

10
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:31,700
The first human being I saw in this copy

11
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:33,650
Already dead!

12
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:43,920
If you're scared, don't look at it

13
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:46,550
Is insurance expensive?

14
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:47,550
good guy

15
00:00:47,550 --> 00:00:49,650
Do you use such dim lights for such details?

16
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:52,250
Next time, just use a red light or a green light.
